# Festag Design Constitution

**Doc:** `docs/festag-design-constitution.md`  
**Tokens:** `lib/design-tokens/festag-canvas.ts`  
**Canvas:** `components/festag-canvas/*`

Festag is a **Software Production Operating System** — not SaaS, not PM, not AI chat.

## Gate (every UI change)

1. Why is this visible **now**? No answer → remove it.
2. Read Mode paper `#F8F6F2` — never pure white canvas, never gray dashboard.
3. Primary `#5B647D` **only** for active attention (path, decision, focus).
4. **One** active path at a time — organic ink, never arrows/flowcharts.
5. Mobile ≠ shrunk desktop — large type, one focus, native story.
6. Typography creates hierarchy — through **size, not weight**; not borders, not card chrome.

## Typography law

Reference surfaces: Auth · Onboarding · Overview-Flow · Popups. Everything else follows them.

| Role | Face / weight |
|---|---|
| Editorial display (large headline) | **Editors Note Medium (500)** — `.display`, `.ffl-greet`, `--font-editorial` |
| Headings `h1`–`h6` (incl. popup H1 `26px`) | **Aeonik Regular (400)** |
| Body / T1 (`15.5px`) · buttons · inputs · nav | **Aeonik Regular (400)** |
| Deliberate emphasis only | Aeonik Medium (500) — `strong`, `.fw-medium`, `.metric` |

- **Aeonik Regular is the default — body *and* headings.** Never set `font-weight: 500` as the
  baseline for a new surface; use `.fw-medium` for one emphasized element.
- **Aeonik Bold is forbidden** (600/700/800 `@font-face` map to Medium).
- Headings between sections inside a popup stay Regular — do not separate them with weight.
- Source of truth: Festag-Typo-Gesetz block in `app/globals.css`.

## Knowledge vs Flow

| Mode | Visual | When |
|---|---|---|
| **Knowledge** | Subtle dots, silent, unconnected | Default — project exists, nothing demands action |
| **Flow** | One path grows → one panel → retract | Tagro speaks / one decision deserves attention |

## Surfaces

Floating paper: soft shadow, invisible border, editorial spacing. No dashboard widgets.

## Tagro

Invisible intelligence — never center stage, never AI theater. Recommendation floats; explanations branch from path.

## Do not build

Jira · ClickUp · Monday · Notion clone · ChatGPT clone · compressed desktop on mobile · permanent decision UI in calm state

When unsure: **remove something**, never add.
